<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <%- include('../partials/head') %>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/pages.css">
</head>
<body>
  <%- include('../partials/age-gate') %>
  <%- include('../partials/header') %>
  <%- include('../partials/cart-drawer') %>

  <main>
    <div class="container pages-hero">
      <nav class="breadcrumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
        <a href="/">Home</a>
        <span>/</span>
        <span aria-current="page">Base Rewards</span>
      </nav>
      <h1>Base Rewards</h1>
      <p class="pages-hero__lead">Member pricing on every order &mdash; no points to track, no tiers to climb. Create a free account and it's applied automatically.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="container impact-stats">
      <div class="impact-stat">
        <strong>1</strong>
        <span>Create a free account</span>
      </div>
      <div class="impact-stat">
        <strong>2</strong>
        <span>Member pricing applies automatically</span>
      </div>
      <div class="impact-stat">
        <strong>3</strong>
        <span>Every order saved to your account</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="container prose-section">
      <h2>How It Works</h2>
      <p>There's no separate rewards card or points balance to keep track of. The prices you see across BudBase are already member prices &mdash; sign up for a free account, and they're applied to every order, automatically, from checkout onward.</p>

      <h2>What You Get</h2>
      <p>Member pricing on the full catalogue, your delivery details saved for faster checkout, and a running history of everything you've ordered, all in one place under <a href="/account">My Account</a>.</p>

      <h2>Why We Do It This Way</h2>
      <p>Punch cards get lost and points expire before you remember to use them. We'd rather just keep prices lower for everyone with an account &mdash; simpler for you, and it means the savings actually get used.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="container" style="padding-bottom: var(--space-9);">
      <a href="/account/signup" class="btn btn-accent">Join Base Rewards</a>
    </div>
  </main>

  <%- include('../partials/footer') %>
  <script src="/js/cart-drawer.js" defer></script>
</body>
</html>
